<title>POLAND: Animex plans to issue 10 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Animex plans to issue 10 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer and trader Animex SA plans to issue 10 million shares ex rights and said the issue would be voted on the firm's extraordinary shareholders meeting on April 18, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Animex said in the Monday statement, after the issue it would have 24,652,500 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Earlier the company said funds from the new issue would be earmarked for its investments in food sector's firms in 1997-2000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
